Phase 2 (FullSpectrum engine emission, P2H): wire infill-filament
resolution at the LayerTools level — FS override toggle, boundary-
layer base-reversion, and grouped manual-pattern infill routing.

Ported from FS v0.9.9 (`ratdoux/OrcaSlicer-FullSpectrum@v0.9.9` commit
b3c41fda), `src/libslic3r/GCode/ToolOrdering.cpp` adds four helpers +
modifies `LayerTools::sparse_infill_filament` /
`LayerTools::solid_infill_filament`.

Why this matters (correctness fix paired with patch 0034):

Patch 0034 (PrintRegion) made the FS infill-filament-override toggle
explicit at preset / extruder-collection time. But sparse_infill_
filament and solid_infill_filament are ALSO called at LayerTools level
to pick the per-layer extruder for an emit-time region. Without the
matching resolution here, the LayerTools picks landed on the raw
sparse_infill_filament config value regardless of the toggle or the
boundary-layer reverts.

This patch adds anonymous-namespace helpers:
- `internal_solid_infill_uses_sparse_filament` — true when solid
  infill at 100% density should be routed like sparse infill.
- `use_base_infill_filament` — honors enable_infill_filament_override
  + infill_filament_use_base_first_layers / _last_layers gates.
- `sparse_infill_filament_id_1based` — selects wall vs. sparse
  filament for a given LayerTools + region.
- `grouped_manual_pattern_infill_filament_1based` — short-circuits
  through MixedFilamentManager::resolve_perimeter when a configured
  filament has a grouped manual_pattern (',' separator). Resolves the
  infill cadence to follow the innermost wall's per-perimeter pick.

`LayerTools::sparse_infill_filament` / `solid_infill_filament` now
check grouped_manual_pattern_infill_filament_1based first (returns
non-zero only for grouped patterns); fall back to the existing
resolve_mixed_1based otherwise.

Verified compile-clean via incremental libslic3r rebuild (3/3
objects, 0 FAILED) + ./gradlew :app:assembleDebug.

Hard dependencies:
  - patch 0015 (MixedFilamentManager::resolve_perimeter +
    is_mixed + mixed_filament_from_id + normalize_manual_pattern)
  - patch 0019 (LayerTools::mixed_mgr / num_physical / layer_index /
    print_z / layer_height_for_mixed members + resolve_mixed_1based)
  - patch 0027 (PrintRegionConfig enable_infill_filament_override +
    use_base_first_layers / _last_layers typed members)
  - patch 0028 (LayerTools::object_layer_count member)

Companion to:
  - 0032 LayerRegion virtual filament resolution (different code path)
  - 0034 PrintRegion infill-filament-override
  - 0035 PrintApply mixed-component expansion

